<title>USA: Eastern Environmental undewriters buy shrs.</title>
<headline>Eastern Environmental undewriters buy shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MT. LAUREL, N.J. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Environmental Services Inc said Monday that the underwriters of its recent public offering of 4.5 million shares of common stock have exercised their option to purchase an additional 675,000 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>The offering, which amounts to 5,175,000 shares and $91.9 million of gross proceeds, is being managed by Smith Barney Inc, Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc, Sanders Morris Mundy, Pacific Growth Equities Inc and Van Kasper &amp; Co.</p>
</text>
